      "id": 1,
      "text": "Old Town Toronto is officially named in 1815, making it the city’s oldest neighborhood.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        9
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.seetorontonow.ca/discovering-the-past-a-journey-through-torontos-old-town/",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The area first appeared as \"Old Town\" by residents, while the newer area was called \"New Town\".",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        30
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Old_Town%2C_Toronto",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Old Town Toronto BIA was founded to protect heritage while encouraging economic vitality, blending old and new businesses.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.seetorontonow.ca/discovering-the-past-a-journey-through-torontos-old-town/",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Lawrence Market Farmers’ Market, a historic trading hub, hosts over 120 vendors and reflects Toronto’s commercial past.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.seetorontonow.ca/discovering-the-past-a-journey-through-torontos-old-town/",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Old Town’s streets still host preserved heritage buildings alongside contemporary establishments, creating a unique blend of eras.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        22
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.seetorontonow.ca/discovering-the-past-a-journey-through-torontos-old-town/",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "The neighborhood has witnessed industrialization, urbanization, and modern expansions over two centuries, yet retains its historical integrity.",
